{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_02_013_23_5_02_013_23",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:ca3ad8029ea80a5386fa3de8f9f825c15d655f1929cbb43c4d3f021a21e0502c",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_02_013_23_5_02_013_23:5_02_013_23:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:246362cdd0b5582337d24a948f6c8d3cafd76c8b6749a01463bc50da53cd3005",
      "text": "啊——稍微有点偏了啊。\n不过如果是这个抓力的强度，按这个角度去抓的话……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_013_23_5_02_013_23:5_02_013_23:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d983a66ca76bdf00e5e29a351978956d0cf66ba9aa2de936afb455b388d5687d",
      "text": "嗯，果然不出所料的位置。\n这样的话下一把就能抓下来了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_013_23_5_02_013_23:5_02_013_23:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f46bf7f5cdc1898624740c67d8d3576544c89e4ccd497417aea7c2ba9f8f559b",
      "text": "享介先生，太厉害了！\n奖品离出口越来越近了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_013_23_5_02_013_23:5_02_013_23:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:56da4e788f096c247c91ed5429b5959a2be97be4c6c935afc9d897dccb14f658",
      "text": "这种分析是我的拿手好戏，尽管交给我吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_013_23_5_02_013_23:5_02_013_23:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:712e8c26504ca347b70ae6f4dffaa44827fe5081c4d0f9b6f868af609acdd357",
      "text": "接下来只要稍微加把劲，应该就行了。\n……好嘞，抓到了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_013_23_5_02_013_23:5_02_013_23:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a34fae72d4ad246e75b628c90f1d7c3748c24914e6638df0d6f2d60b4c8a41c6",
      "text": "给，这个。\n送给●●●●●●●●●●监督。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_013_23_5_02_013_23:5_02_013_23:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b682dceeca50cc2d0d0df3dba3fbec7ce20e851acae4bebddce97d54f2fda6a6",
      "text": "诶。难得是享介先生抓到的，\n真的可以送给我吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_013_23_5_02_013_23:5_02_013_23:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:222a1b1227522e8f2f08e34d8db6fa19a2e1c446dd987d98f51c280b6f0e5633",
      "text": "因为监督之前说过想要这个对吧？\n就当作是我送你的白色情人节回礼啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_013_23_5_02_013_23:5_02_013_23:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d56704fcefeea5b2369e8dbeb74f17af79c8bed15999c2f3765196f5d7951dbe",
      "text": "那么，我就恭敬不如从命收下了。\n非常感谢！我会好好珍惜的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_013_23_5_02_013_23:5_02_013_23:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ddcfe8ed18011be007df623ea133d122a42deacc49eba3c6be0a4572c1f48d5d",
      "text": "你能高兴就太好啦。以后要是还有想要的东西，\n我都帮你抓，随时跟我说哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
